---
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
// Failover: detect, choose, reconfigure. Numbers are illustrative.
---
<figure class="rf">
  <div class="rf-scroll">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 292" role="img" aria-label="Failover in three steps. 1: decide the leader is dead, using a timeout such as 30 seconds without a reply. 2: pick the follower with the most recent data. 3: reconfigure so clients write to the new leader, followers follow it, and the old leader steps down if it returns.">
    <rect x="10" y="10" width="280" height="272" rx="4" class="box" />
    <rect x="310" y="10" width="280" height="272" rx="4" class="box" />
    <rect x="610" y="10" width="280" height="272" rx="4" class="box" />
    <text x="24" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>1. Decide the leader is dead</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. Kết luận leader đã chết</tspan></text>
    <rect x="30" y="62" width="120" height="64" rx="4" class="box bad" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={132} y={62} size={26} />
    <text x="90" y="92" text-anchor="middle" class="t-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader</tspan></text>
    <text x="90" y="112" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>no reply</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>không trả lời</tspan></text>
    <line x1="152.0" y1="94.0" x2="191.0" y2="94.0" class="edge dash" /><polygon points="200.0,94.0 191.0,89.5 191.0,98.5" class="head dash" />
    <DiagramIcon name="stopwatch" x={236} y={94} size={40} />
    <text x="236" y="132" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>30 s</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>30 s</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="176" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>No reply for 30 s (an example</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không trả lời trong 30 s (ví dụ</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="195" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>timeout) means "assume dead".</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>timeout) thì coi như đã chết.</tspan></text>
    <text x="24" y="214" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>There is no sure way to know.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Không có cách nào biết chắc.</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>2. Choose a new leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. Chọn leader mới</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="56" width="252" height="44" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={346} y={78} size={26} />
    <text x="370" y="75" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower A</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower A</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="92" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>up to #41</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tới #41</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="108" width="252" height="44" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={346} y={130} size={26} />
    <text x="370" y="127" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower B</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower B</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="144" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>up to #43, newest: chosen</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tới #43, mới nhất: chọn</tspan></text>
    <rect x="324" y="160" width="252" height="44" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={346} y={182} size={26} />
    <text x="370" y="179" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Follower C</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower C</tspan></text>
    <text x="370" y="196" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>up to #42</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tới #42</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="232" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Pick the follower with the most</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Chọn follower có dữ liệu mới</tspan></text>
    <text x="324" y="251" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>recent data: it loses the least.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhất: mất ít nhất.</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="36" class="t-hs"><tspan data-lang-en>3. Reconfigure</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. Cấu hình lại</tspan></text>
    <rect x="624" y="56" width="116" height="60" rx="4" class="box ok" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={722} y={56} size={26} />
    <text x="682" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>New leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader mới</tspan></text>
    <text x="682" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>takes writes</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>nhận lệnh ghi</tspan></text>
    <line x1="742.0" y1="86.0" x2="769.0" y2="86.0" class="edge ok" /><polygon points="778.0,86.0 769.0,81.5 769.0,90.5" class="head ok" />
    <rect x="780" y="56" width="96" height="60" rx="4" class="box" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={858} y={56} size={26} />
    <text x="828" y="84" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Followers</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Follower</tspan></text>
    <text x="828" y="102" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>follow it</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>theo nó</tspan></text>
    <rect x="624" y="134" width="116" height="60" rx="4" class="box bad empty" />
    <DiagramIcon name="db" x={722} y={134} size={26} />
    <text x="682" y="160" text-anchor="middle" class="t-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Old leader</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Leader cũ</tspan></text>
    <text x="682" y="178" text-anchor="middle" class="t-bad"><tspan data-lang-en>steps down</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>lùi xuống</tspan></text>
    <DiagramIcon name="laptop" x={808} y={164} size={32} />
    <line x1="786.0" y1="164.0" x2="750.1" y2="94.0" class="edge ok" /><polygon points="746.0,86.0 746.1,96.1 754.1,92.0" class="head ok" />
    <text x="836" y="198" text-anchor="middle" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>clients</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>client</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="232" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>Clients write to the new leader;</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Client ghi vào leader mới;</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="251" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>the old one must not come back</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>leader cũ không được quay lại</tspan></text>
    <text x="624" y="270" class="t-note"><tspan data-lang-en>and keep writing.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>và tiếp tục ghi.</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>Three steps, and each one can go wrong. The 30 second timeout and the entry numbers are illustrative.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Ba bước, và bước nào cũng có thể hỏng. Timeout 30 giây và số entry chỉ để minh hoạ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .rf { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .rf-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .rf svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .rf text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .rf .t-h { font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-hs { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-b { font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-note { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .t-mono { font-size: 12px; font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace; fill: var(--text); }
  .rf .t-bad { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .t-ok { fill: var(--text); font-weight: 700; font-size: 13px; }
  .rf .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .rf .box.strong { stroke: var(--text); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.ok { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .box.empty { fill: none; stroke-dasharray: 4 3; }
  .rf .box.bad.empty { fill: none; }
  .rf .edge { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; fill: none; }
  .rf .edge.dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.bad { stroke: var(--red); stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .rf .edge.ok { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .rf .head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .rf .head.bad { fill: var(--red); }
  .rf .head.ok { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .rf figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
